<title>USA: TENNIS-CHAMPIONS CUP MEN'S RESULTS FROM INDIAN WELLS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHAMPIONS CUP MEN'S RESULTS FROM INDIAN WELLS.</headline>
<dateline>INDIAN WELLS, California 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at</p>
<p>the $2.3 million Champions Cup men's tennis tournament on</p>
<p>Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Quarter-finals</p>
<p>2-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat Mark Philippoussis (Australia)</p>
<p>6-3 7-6 (10-8)</p>
<p>Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat 14-Alberto Berasategui (Spain)</p>
<p>6-2 6-3</p>
<p>3-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>Bohdan Ulihrach (Czech Republic) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
</text>
